From 17e12fabd342139c21e57764ef235bd2a6462881 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:48:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Separate ordinary validation from coin storage with
 operational read errors

Add a read-only lookup boundary preserving the map-backed oracle. Database failures and mismatched stored outpoints return StorageError rather than consensus Invalid. Exercise every spend and output-collision read failure without publishing partial effects; the ordinary validator suite passes.
---
